# Deploy by default

After finishing a user-requested change in this project, commit and push to `main` without waiting to be asked, unless the user explicitly says not to ship yet.

- Remote is SSH: `git@github.com:Dewyue/qiuzhao-schedule.git`
- Pushing `main` triggers GitHub Pages
- Keep the usual commit message quality; do not force-push
